  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人文新注目-社會設計",
    "sub_ename": "NEW ATTENTION TO HUMANITIES - SOCIAL DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程係對應課程目標二之規畫，當社會或環境不夠美好時，就是社會設計的機會！世界正發生歷史交叉點，即社會發展走向設計思考、設計發展走向社會思考。因此，社會設計（social design）不只是設計的社會責任（生態、環保、永續、人文等）而已，社會設計成為人類讓社會更美好的共構領域，即在各領域中，促使社會更好的工作者都是社會設計師。\n    本課程透過分析社會設計理論、技術與方法，反思理論方法與相關案例問題，建立學子理解社會設計知識之外，也經由實務操作社會設計專題演練，除了培養學子關注社會問題，昇華周遭美學的概念，以及增進以設計解決社會問題的知能。\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course corresponds to the planning of course objective 2. As the society or environment is not beautiful enough, it is an opportunity for social design! The world is experiencing a historic intersection; that is, social development is moving towards design thinking, and design development is moving towards social thinking. Therefore, social design is not only the social responsibility of design (ecology, environmental protection, sustainability, humanities, etc.); social design has become a common field for human beings to make society better. That is, in all fields, workers who promote a better society are social designers.\n    By analyzing social design theories, techniques and methods, reflecting on theoretical methods and related case issues, this course not only builds students' understanding of social design knowledge, but also cultivates students' attention to social issues, to sublimate the concept of surrounding aesthetics, and enhances the knowledge of solving social problems through design.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生深化社會設計議題思考及人文價值判斷。",
      "describe_en": "Let students deepen their thinking on social design issues and humanistic value judgments."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "引導學生建立與應用社會設計的創意與知識。",
      "describe_en": " Guide students to establish and apply the creativity and knowledge of social design."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "提升學生社會設計的跨域技能及實務能力。",
      "describe_en": " Improve students' cross-domain skills and practical ability in social design."
    }
  ],
